    skos:prefLabel 'WP-2-style net'@en ;
    skos:definition 'Plankton net described as WP-2-style net; designed with single circular mouth piece; with filtering net shape cylindrical-conical; with further specifications either unknown or described elsewhere in the supporting metadata.'@en ;
